  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "黃昏ê平洋"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HIxanZxb35c?si=7h1zACXr28YVPpql\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\"></iframe></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>黃子佳</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭已經沓沓仔行到西爿ê平洋頂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天邊lóng是紅kòng-kòng ê光影</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">跤踏車騎tī黃昏ê田庄仔路</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　kánn-ná尾蝶仔leh飛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">兩爿lóng是闊bóng-bóng ê芋仔園</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">芋仔tú-tsiah種無偌久</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一排一排親像囡仔徛tī hia</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風一下吹--過-來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細細古錐ê葉仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">歡歡喜喜kā我ia̍t手</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">送hōo我一tsūn一tsūn青春ê滋味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭已經勻勻仔beh tuì西爿tshū--落-去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">田中ng koh留一寡仔光光ê色彩</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我騎tī心適ê路途</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看白雲tī水田內tshi-bú-tshi̍h-tshū</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無閒leh講今仔日tn̄g--著ê代誌</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">白翎鷥起起落落</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　kā優雅送hōo田園</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">田嬰大群來大群去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">草埔是in走標ê運動埕</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭已經khuann-khuann仔bī入去西爿ê海洋</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">草欉內底ê白面雞「oo-ua」叫</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聲聲呼喚心愛--ê早歸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮向日落ê方向行注目禮</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像鳥隻回siū</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Uat倒tńg--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj5QLuyY-zAmaN_wWPGB_Z-3Z2meNq29XkxPqZ2VthP8fHkKEX32f9mOiuyQFob5H_jOoaMZo6yegiCQKjO84e2wOScX34kIQEsF7zTKqkJZhjt6TAxVMl61HylesqVD-M-9nAV8_f7eyX1swU3TN_mIhUUN1E-JMoF_TSUXzU5I-pFwJAW00AodaBf3Acm/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1357%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj5QLuyY-zAmaN_wWPGB_Z-3Z2meNq29XkxPqZ2VthP8fHkKEX32f9mOiuyQFob5H_jOoaMZo6yegiCQKjO84e2wOScX34kIQEsF7zTKqkJZhjt6TAxVMl61HylesqVD-M-9nAV8_f7eyX1swU3TN_mIhUUN1E-JMoF_TSUXzU5I-pFwJAW00AodaBf3Acm/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1357%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKDHHr4_HemD_8lXwEbUa-8XJeJcdMBt0N9_x2GXQJwDWcthu2Ah2DRYAviY28oGAqRx2tHdqefQw9abU7cAXb-5bVTF74YFz8BkY4t6eMyeOP8ZlMexQv0e93MxPFncJZJxKlcAtnL_-9Bskrm8GQRAV5N23fHVwdauImCeugjol2ZIl7dBK1U6lVDgz6/s1424/357%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKDHHr4_HemD_8lXwEbUa-8XJeJcdMBt0N9_x2GXQJwDWcthu2Ah2DRYAviY28oGAqRx2tHdqefQw9abU7cAXb-5bVTF74YFz8BkY4t6eMyeOP8ZlMexQv0e93MxPFncJZJxKlcAtnL_-9Bskrm8GQRAV5N23fHVwdauImCeugjol2ZIl7dBK1U6lVDgz6/w450-h640/357%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#做伙來唸詩&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class